*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Dictionary Object: Table Type ZTT_IBAN
*& Create in SE11 → Table types
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*
* Table type : ZTT_IBAN
* Line type  : ZST_IBAN  (structure with single field IBAN TYPE IBAN)
* Access     : Standard table, no key defined (selection screen ranges)
*
* Alternatively use RANGE type: ZRT_IBAN (RANGE OF IBAN)
* which gives SIGN/OPTION/LOW/HIGH – preferred for selection screens.
*
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Table type : ZTT_PRODUCT
* Line type  : ZST_PRODUCT (structure with single field PRODUCT TYPE CHAR40)
* Access     : Standard table, no key defined
*
* Alternatively: ZRT_PRODUCT (RANGE OF CHAR40)
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
